There is a new package rDVR to aid testing at https://github.com/johndharrison/rDVR.
The github page is at https://github.com/johndharrison/rDVR. There is a vignette on operation
Recording R Sessions with rDVR: An example using RSelenium
at http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/15176.
rDVR is a Cross Platform (Lin/Win/OSx) DVR for R allowing you to record your rsession with commands something like:

require(rDVR)
startVServer() # utility function to start a video server
DVR <- rDVR()
DVR$start()
# Do your thing for upto 10 minutes
DVR$save()
DVR$closeServer()

Comments and Suggestions welcome

Best Regards

John

