The way you have it setup, if there's a fatal error in functions.R you would never get to the part where you define your UI.

You could look at including that code in global.R if you also are using it on your server. But I'd bet that some code in there is causing the problem (missing library? typo?) If you remove that source() call and any references to variables in your UI that would have been defined in that file, you may get it running then you can figure out what's causing the problem.

Jeff

